 of adventures can live vicariously through the travels, conquests, explorations, creation of empires, struggles and situations that confront the main characters, actual historical figures or protagonists. Under the category of adventures, we can include traditional swashbucklers, serialized films, and historical spectacles, searches or expeditions for lost continents, \"jungle\" and \"desert\" epics, treasure hunts and quests, disaster films, and heroic journeys or searches for the unknown. Adventure films are often, but not always, set in an historical period, and may include adapted stories of historical or literary adventure heroes, kings, battles, rebellion, or piracy.","totalMediaCount":10897,"slug":"adventure","nsfw":false,"childCount":0},"relationships":{"parent":{"links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/157/relationships/parent","related":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/157/parent"}},"anime":{"links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/157/relationships/anime","related":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/157/anime"}},"drama":{"links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/157/relationships/drama","related":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/157/drama"}},"manga":{"links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/157/relationships/manga","related":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/157/manga"}}}},{"id":"67","type":"categories","links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/67"},"attributes":{"createdAt":"2017-05-31T06:38:49.899Z","updatedAt":"2021-10-02T01:30:59.073Z","title":"Demon","description":"In Western lore, demons are often described as minions from Hell, generally known to attack humans and feast on their flesh or possess the bodies of those with weak souls. In Eastern lore, on the other hand, they are generally supernatural, often but not always malevolent beings who can be more mischievous than actually evil, or simply supernatural spirits of no specific alignment.","totalMediaCount":2020,"slu